ish", "review": "Palworld has been incredible with features even as a game in Early development. This game has so much potential and looking forward to even more features. Palworld has visually appealing locations with diverse conditions.  Honestly awaiting it's grand release in 2026 and I wish Pocketpair all the best going ahead with the game.\n\nI am back to Palworld after a while but I thought I should give an update as a part of a Palworld player base who played it earlier on. There are a lot of improvements in features and stuff you can do. A lot of new Pals, areas, collabs that bring great amount of content to the game has made it essentially an outstanding one even on early release.\n\nIf you are still new here, there are some bugs/glitches around the game, hopefully they will get fixed and it's still in early access as of 2025 December. Other than that, this game is awesome to play and I'm glad I got it! I would 100% Recommend this game to anyone wanting all-in-one experience of a [b]Survival, Shooter, Action-Adventure, Co-op[/b] games. Recommend 9/10", "timestamp_created": 1732303949, "timestamp_updated": 1766566339, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "179590751", "author": {"steamid": "76561198393930207", "personaname": "DarK5x", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/dark5x1/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 3645, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 3595, "last_played": 1786720839, "avatar": "d84d56b37bb698158830696b3bef366e16777271"}, "language": "english", "review": "i really love this game", "timestamp_created": 1732302617, "timestamp_updated": 1732302617, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny"